# Heart 8 scenes, quests, social profiles and reactions for the six Enhanced villagers (docs/narrative/BIBLE_ENHANCED.md). Compiled to zz_fs_enhanced.json.

dialogue marcus.roof
n0 marcus: Pitch, rafters, shingles. Drawn nine times. Every time it looks right. Every time I'm afraid it won't hold.
  expr thinking
  next n1
n1 marcus: Six winters, it's been nearly fixed. ...What would you do?
  ? Measure it with you, properly. => r0 | friend:marcus,15 | flag:choice.roof.measure
  ? Try a different pitch. => r1 | friend:marcus,10 | flag:choice.roof.design
  ? I'll hold the ladder. I'm good at holding. => r2 | friend:marcus,10 | flag:choice.roof.ladder
r0 marcus: Measure with me. Yes. You take the end of the tape. Once. Twice. ...Three times.
  expr happy
r1 marcus: A new pitch. I'd stopped asking that question. ...Show me the angle. Slowly.
r2 marcus: The ladder. Plain, steady, necessary. Best offer anyone's made that roof.
  expr happy

dialogue odalys.office
n0 odalys: I tell everyone to rest. I have never once done it on a weekday. This is unfamiliar. Be gentle.
  expr thinking
  next n1
n1 odalys: So, [player]. Your professional opinion? I'll be taking notes.
  ? Insist that she rests tonight. => r0 | friend:odalys,10 | flag:choice.office.insist
  ? Pull up a chair and share the soup. => r1 | friend:odalys,15 | flag:choice.office.soup
  ? Write her a prescription of your own. => r2 | friend:odalys,10 | flag:choice.office.write
r0 odalys: You insist. ...Accepted. Under protest, with soup, and in front of a witness.
r1 odalys: Two spoons, one pot. That's the entire treatment. You diagnosed me faster than I would have.
  expr happy
r2 odalys: A prescription. For me. 'Come back anyway.' ...I've never been given orders I wanted to follow.
  expr happy

dialogue felix.big
n0 -: Something very large tugs on Felix's line. It might be a fish. It might be the bottom of the pond.
  next n1
n1 felix: It's this big. No, this big. ...Partner, what do we do?
  ? Net it. => r0 | friend:felix,10 | flag:choice.big.net
  ? Let it go. => r1 | friend:felix,15 | flag:choice.big.release
  ? Measure it honestly. => r2 | friend:felix,10 | flag:choice.big.measure
r0 felix: The net! Hold steady. ...There she is! A beauty. I'll never doubt your wrist again.
  expr happy
r1 felix: Let it go? ...Right. A good fish deserves a long life. We keep the story. It's bigger anyway.
  expr happy
r2 felix: Honestly. Fine. Eleven inches. ...It was this big a moment ago. I blame the light.
  emote sweat

dialogue dorian.notebook
n0 -: Dorian takes a small, worn notebook from his coat. He holds it shut a long moment.
  next n1
n1 dorian: Mushrooms. Drawn. Hundreds. Nobody's seen them. ...Be gentle.
  ? Tell him they're lovely. => r0 | friend:dorian,10 | flag:choice.notebook.praise
  ? Ask to keep one. => r1 | friend:dorian,15 | flag:choice.notebook.ask
  ? Draw one back. Give it a face. => r2 | friend:dorian,10 | flag:choice.notebook.draw
r0 dorian: Lovely. First time for that word. It goes in the margin.
  expr happy
r1 dorian: One. Take the small brown one, under the fern. It's me, mostly.
  expr happy
r2 dorian: It has a face. Mushrooms don't. ...This one does now. I love it.
  expr happy

dialogue elara.list
n0 -: Elara unrolls a paper longer than the desk. It is covered in tiny writing and little doodled boats.
  next n1
n1 elara: Places I've never been. Forty-one of them. Crossed off: none. ...Well? Say something before I roll it back up.
  ? Let's pick one. Together. => r0 | friend:elara,15 | flag:choice.list.pick
  ? Add one more place to it. => r1 | friend:elara,10 | flag:choice.list.add
  ? Promise to visit. I'll even pack. => r2 | friend:elara,10 | flag:choice.list.promise
r0 elara: Together! The sea, from a boat. I'm circling it. I'm packing a sandwich. I'm already packing!
  expr happy
r1 elara: A new one! Forty-two! I'll draw it a tiny boat. You've made my whole week. Don't tell Dr. Penn.
  expr happy
r2 elara: You promise? ...I'm writing that down. In ink. And I'll knit you a sock for the journey. Just the one, for luck.
  expr happy

dialogue ione.shelf
n0 -: At the back of the library stands a tall shelf. Every book has a slip of paper tucked inside. Not one slip has a name.
  next n1
n1 ione: Books I set aside for people who never came in. The oldest has waited nine years. I can't reshelve them. What would you do?
  ? Take one to someone who should have it. => r0 | friend:ione,15 | flag:choice.shelf.take
  ? Read one aloud, right here. => r1 | friend:ione,10 | flag:choice.shelf.read
  ? Tuck a note in one, for whoever comes. => r2 | friend:ione,10 | flag:choice.shelf.note
r0 ione: Take one. ...To someone who'll actually read it. Yes. That's all any of them wanted.
  expr happy
r1 ione: Aloud? Nobody has ever read these to anyone. Go slowly, please. They'll want to keep up.
  expr happy
r2 ione: A note, in a book nobody's opened. Now whoever comes will know someone was expecting them.
  expr happy


addto npc.marcus.talk
4 hearts:marcus>=3 && quest:marcus_planks=new && flag:met.marcus => marcus.planks.ask
4 quest:marcus_planks=active => marcus.planks.remind
5 quest:marcus_planks=active && has:resource.wood>=10 => marcus.planks.turnin
dialogue marcus.planks.ask
n0 marcus: Ten planks for the hall roof. Oak if you have it. I'd ask someone else, but you hold a plank well.
  next n1
n1 marcus: Ten planks, then. I'll measure twice. You'll fetch once.
  ? Yes, I'll bring it. => r0 | quest.start:marcus_planks
  ? Not right now. => r1
r0 marcus: Good. I'll have the tape out.
  expr happy
r1 marcus: No hurry. The roof has waited this long.

dialogue marcus.planks.remind
n0 marcus: Ten planks of wood for the hall roof. I'll measure twice.

dialogue marcus.planks.turnin
n0 marcus: Ten planks. Good grain. Straight. Thank you, [player]. The roof's a bit less nearly fixed.
  + quest.done:marcus_planks
  expr happy

addto npc.odalys.talk
4 hearts:odalys>=3 && quest:odalys_elderflower=new && flag:met.odalys => odalys.elder.ask
4 quest:odalys_elderflower=active => odalys.elder.remind
5 quest:odalys_elderflower=active && has:forage.elderflower>=3 => odalys.elder.turnin
dialogue odalys.elder.ask
n0 odalys: Three bunches of elderflower, for a tonic. Pick them yourself. Then you'll know the smell when it's time to pick them again.
  next n1
n1 odalys: Three. Fresh, and found by you. I'll prescribe you a cup of the tonic in return.
  ? Yes, I'll bring it. => r0 | quest.start:odalys_elderflower
  ? Not right now. => r1
r0 odalys: Good. I'll have the kettle ready.
  expr happy
r1 odalys: Understood. Do not let it keep you up at night.

dialogue odalys.elder.remind
n0 odalys: Three elderflowers, picked by you. Fresh. I'll note the lesson in the ledger.

dialogue odalys.elder.turnin
n0 odalys: Elderflower. Fresh, and picked right. Thank you, [player]. You know the smell now. That is the first ingredient.
  + quest.done:odalys_elderflower
  expr happy

addto npc.felix.talk
4 hearts:felix>=3 && quest:felix_bait=new && flag:met.felix => felix.bait.ask
4 quest:felix_bait=active => felix.bait.remind
5 quest:felix_bait=active && has:resource.bait>=5 => felix.bait.turnin
dialogue felix.bait.ask
n0 felix: Make your own bait. Five. A partner should know how. I sell the stuff, but I'd rather you didn't buy it.
  next n1
n1 felix: Five, made by you. Then we fish the dawn tide together, and I'll know you're ready.
  ? Yes, I'll bring it. => r0 | quest.start:felix_bait
  ? Not right now. => r1
r0 felix: Good. The tide'll keep.
  expr happy
r1 felix: No matter. The fish aren't going anywhere. Mostly.

dialogue felix.bait.remind
n0 felix: Five bait, your own. The tide's waiting.

dialogue felix.bait.turnin
n0 felix: Bait. Five. Your own hands. Thank you, [player]. Now you're a partner. The first fish is yours.
  + quest.done:felix_bait
  expr happy

addto npc.dorian.talk
4 hearts:dorian>=3 && quest:dorian_basket=new && flag:met.dorian => dorian.basket.ask
4 quest:dorian_basket=active => dorian.basket.remind
5 quest:dorian_basket=active && has:forage.mushroom>=3 => dorian.basket.turnin
dialogue dorian.basket.ask
n0 dorian: Find three mushrooms. Yourself. Look down. Everyone looks up.
  next n1
n1 dorian: Bring them here. I'll tell you which ones you got right.
  ? Yes, I'll bring it. => r0 | quest.start:dorian_basket
  ? Not right now. => r1
r0 dorian: ...Good. Thank you.
  expr happy
r1 dorian: ...Fine. The forest is patient.

dialogue dorian.basket.remind
n0 dorian: Three mushrooms. Found, not bought. Look down.

dialogue dorian.basket.turnin
n0 dorian: Mushrooms. Three. All good ones. Thank you, [player]. You looked down. The forest noticed.
  + quest.done:dorian_basket
  expr happy

addto npc.elara.talk
4 hearts:elara>=3 && quest:elara_wool=new && flag:met.elara => elara.wool.ask
4 quest:elara_wool=active => elara.wool.remind
5 quest:elara_wool=active && has:product.wool>=2 => elara.wool.turnin
dialogue elara.wool.ask
n0 elara: I'm out of wool! Two skeins, if you can. The scarf is at the length of a dog. It wants to be a horse.
  next n1
n1 elara: Two wool! I'll knit you something. A sock, probably.
  ? Yes, I'll bring it. => r0 | quest.start:elara_wool
  ? Not right now. => r1
r0 elara: Yay! The scarf thanks you in advance!
  expr happy
r1 elara: That's okay! I'll knit the scarf a little patience.

dialogue elara.wool.remind
n0 elara: Two wool for the scarf. It's already the length of a dog.

dialogue elara.wool.turnin
n0 elara: Wool! Soft and warm. Thank you, [player]! The scarf will now reach the next village.
  + quest.done:elara_wool
  expr happy

addto npc.ione.talk
4 hearts:ione>=3 && quest:ione_pearl=new && flag:met.ione => ione.pearl.ask
4 quest:ione_pearl=active => ione.pearl.remind
5 quest:ione_pearl=active && has:forage.pearl>=1 => ione.pearl.turnin
dialogue ione.pearl.ask
n0 ione: A pearl. One. For the reading room. I keep one in my favorite book, and it's tarnished. I'd like a new one.
  next n1
n1 ione: A pearl. Small, quiet, and round. I'll set a book aside for you.
  ? Yes, I'll bring it. => r0 | quest.start:ione_pearl
  ? Not right now. => r1
r0 ione: Thank you. I'll set a chair aside for when you're back.
  expr happy
r1 ione: Of course. Requests here never go overdue.

dialogue ione.pearl.remind
n0 ione: One pearl for the reading room. I'll set a book aside.

dialogue ione.pearl.turnin
n0 ione: A pearl. Perfect. Quiet and round. Thank you, [player]. It's going in the front of a very old book.
  + quest.done:ione_pearl
  expr happy
